{"id": 3, "ts": 1780479431.790774, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I\u2019d like to start by putting Candidate\u202fC forward as my provisional recommendation. The most safety\u2011critical attributes for a long\u2011distance pilot\u2014operational reliability and decision quality\u2014are clearly demonstrated: Candidate\u202fC is described as \u201c100\u202f% reliable\u201d and \u201ccan make correct decisions quickly.\u201d Moreover, they \u201ccreate a positive atmosphere with his crew,\u201d which suggests good crew cooperation despite the noted communication difficulty. While the difficulty communicating ideas and the egocentric attitude are concerns, the reliability and rapid, correct decision\u2011making are paramount for international flights, and the positive crew atmosphere indicates that the communication shortfall has not yet translated into a disruptive cockpit environment. Until we hear contradictory evidence, I believe Candidate\u202fC offers the strongest overall fit."}
