{"id": 7, "ts": 1780479484.4159644, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I appreciate Sarah\u2019s emphasis on Candidate\u202fC\u2019s reliability and rapid decision\u2011making, but I\u2019m less convinced that those strengths outweigh the communication difficulty and egocentric attitude noted for C. On long\u2011distance flights, clear, collaborative communication is essential; a pilot who struggles to convey ideas can jeopardize crew coordination and safety. In contrast, Candidate\u202fB demonstrates very strong stress resilience (\u201chandles stress very well\u201d) and operational reliability (\u201cvery conscientious\u201d), plus solid technical support (\u201cexcellent computer skills\u201d) and good weather assessment\u2014critical for international routes. While B is sometimes perceived as pretentious and may adopt the wrong tone, those issues appear less severe than C\u2019s fundamental communication barrier. Given the balance of reliability, stress handling, and overall crew cooperation potential, I would recommend Candidate\u202fB."}
