{"id": 32, "ts": 1780479672.9651093, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fB is the strongest overall fit. Emily\u2019s reminder that we have **no evidence of Candidate\u202fC\u2019s stress\u2011resilience or technical competence** leaves a critical safety gap for C, while B is explicitly noted to **handle stress very well** and possesses **excellent computer skills**, indicating solid technical aptitude for complex, data\u2011driven long\u2011haul operations. Although B can be pretentious and occasionally uncooperative, those concerns are less decisive than the absence of any data on C\u2019s ability to stay calm under pressure or manage demanding systems. Until we obtain comparable evidence for D, B remains the best balance of reliability, stress handling, and technical capability."}
